cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the aiprov method, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file; the preferred citation is the accompanying paper.
type: software
title: "ai-provenance (aiprov): verifiable AI provenance as an executable skill"
abstract: >-
  Domain-agnostic AI provenance tracking over PROV-O: agent, activity, and
  entity classes for AI-in-the-loop work, full inference telemetry
  (tokens, cost, energy, prompts as plans, transcripts), a source
  verification ladder with human-only rungs, a conformance validator
  suitable as a CI gate, and packaging as an executable Agent Skill that an
  AI agent operates itself. Generalized from the F(AI)²R experiment.
